cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Cite the software snapshot using this metadata and its exact commit or tag.
  Cite the original papers separately when using their methods. This repository
  is research software, not a published validation study of measured fabrics.
type: software
title: Textile Optics Engine
version: 0.2.0
authors:
  - name: Phill-lms
repository-code: https://github.com/Phill-lms/textile-optics-engine
abstract: >-
  An explicit fiber-to-ply-to-yarn-to-woven-fabric research engine with
  versioned geometry, constituent optical spectra, validated local 2D wave
  and ray adapters, and multi-material 3D fiber path tracing. Developed under
  user direction with AI assistance. Current examples use synthetic materials
  and prescribed geometry; manufacturing mechanics and measured-fabric
  fidelity remain separate validation tasks.
keywords:
  - computational imaging
  - textile microgeometry
  - woven fabric
  - fiber scattering
  - optical simulation
  - research software
